C sase-fb[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Stop silently losing agent bead closes written in ephemeral [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]workspaces[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A `sase bead close` run by an agent inside a numbered workspace [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]either reaches the canonical bead store or fails loudly. The CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]never prints `✓ Closed` for a mutation that exists only in a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]workspace-local sidecar clone, workspace eviction can never destroy[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]unpublished canonical bead commits, and the post-completion [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]finalizer verifies published state instead of the local projection.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bead_close_publication_loss.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/bead_close_publication_loss.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-fb[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-fb/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make every bead-store mutation publication-verified before the[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]CLI reports success[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]publish[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish: after a bead mutation commits, verify the commit actually [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reached the canonical remote; force a synchronous publish when it did [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]not, and fail the command loudly when it still cannot publish, instead [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of returning 0 on a workspace-local-only write.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Refuse to evict a workspace sidecar clone that holds [/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]unpublished bead commits[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]evict[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]evict: teach the launch-time workspace bead safety net about the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar-repos layout and wire it into the eviction path so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`clear_workspace_repos` can never trash a `sase--beads` clone with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unpushed canonical bead commits.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify published bead state in the post-completion finalizer[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]finalize[dim] · [dim][/dim]after publish[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]finalize: make the finalizer's bead safety net publish and verify rather[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]than only commit, and stop instructing agents to confirm a close with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command that reads the local projection.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-fb","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-fb.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-3d5c60b12f5a468b40e87a6a74838944","started_at":"2026-08-05T19:47:48.960134+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"9a8b4eabfee1366acd8e341cfb54ba859eed71f244a3d03701522c33ff41d5df","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-fb.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"a792a8c58aa938294299e7f547bf40b43923039041872e8ef037682da1f1bd30","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-fb.land/meta.json","size_bytes":576},"prompt":{"digest":"e3a6b247441fc6e8a773bbef565d5f3832ebf1547c469b1d55c4c357d6649a35","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-fb.land/prompt.md","size_b